▶ Feature: Multi-Stage Plugin Layout & Protocol Contracts
  ✔ manifest and skills declare fixed reviewer identities (1.8944ms)
  ✔ pre-commit hook derives the repository from its own trusted path without invoking Git (0.383ms)
  ✔ reviewer-kit is configured as a blocking orchestrator with exact specialist spawns (2.3656ms)
  ✔ reviewer-kit body enforces 4-stage ordering, report sections, and solitary marker (1.1647ms)
  ✔ review-profile contract: spec-docs reduced path is pinned across skill, orchestrator, and specialists (0.3032ms)
  ✔ review-profile contract: the native assignment names the profile and the staged snapshot manifest (17.4952ms)
  ✔ coverage gate pins the impact floor, the test-class exemption, and per-item harness scoping (0.9405ms)
  ✔ dispatcher dispatches without reading files and passes skill names downstream (0.2592ms)
  ✔ all review subagents strictly exclude mutation tools and task spawning (0.3583ms)
